-/**
- * @file     ekf_of.c
- * @brief    6-state body-frame OF position + velocity-bias Kalman Filter.
- *
- * State:   x[0]=pos_x  x[1]=vel_x  x[2]=bias_x
- *          x[3]=pos_y  x[4]=vel_y  x[5]=bias_y
- *
